    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it was super weird. it wasnt just one constant drone, it was like a pattern of bursts. i heard something like: long-short-short-long, then a quick triple tap, then a long pause. it felt very intentional, like a handshake or a sync signal. if i give you the timing of the pulses, do you think you could help me map it to what's actually happening in the stream?",
