      "role": "user",
      "content": "that actually makes a lot of sense, it felt exactly like that. like the signal was trying to establish itself. i caught another bit of it right after the pause. there was this very sharp, high-pitched staccato burst right before it died down, like a rapid series of tiny clicks. if that was part of the handshake, what kind of data would be sent right after the sync? does it sound like a specific type of encrypted traffic to you?",
